          "sourceRegion": "Question 6, left beneath the stem",
          "description": "Two oblique straight lines with plain endpoints. Top sector has 130° without an arc; right and bottom sectors have arcs and labels 2g and 4f. The left sector is unlabelled.",
          "mathematics": "Vertically opposite angles give 4f=130. Adjacent angles on a straight line give 130+2g=180. Algebraic labels have no printed degree symbols.",
